---
import '../styles/global.css';
import { site } from '../site';

interface Props {
  title?: string;
  description?: string;
  index?: boolean;
}
const { title = site.title, description = site.description, index = true } = Astro.props;
const canonical = new URL(Astro.url.pathname, Astro.site ?? `https://${site.domain}`);
const og = new URL('/og-image.png', canonical);
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
    <title>{title}</title>
    <meta name="description" content={description} />
    {!index && <meta name="robots" content="noindex" />}
    <link rel="canonical" href={canonical} />
    <meta property="og:type" content="website" />
    <meta property="og:site_name" content={site.name} />
    <meta property="og:title" content={title} />
    <meta property="og:description" content={description} />
    <meta property="og:url" content={canonical} />
    <meta property="og:image" content={og} />
    <meta property="og:image:width" content="1200" />
    <meta property="og:image:height" content="630" />
    <meta name="twitter:card" content="summary_large_image" />
    <meta name="theme-color" content="#06070a" />
    <link rel="icon" href="/favicon.ico" sizes="16x16 32x32 48x48" />
    <link rel="icon" href="/favicon.svg" type="image/svg+xml" sizes="any" />
    <link rel="apple-touch-icon" href="/apple-touch-icon.png" sizes="180x180" />
    <link rel="manifest" href="/site.webmanifest" />
    <link rel="sitemap" href="/sitemap-index.xml" />
    <link rel="preload" href="/fonts/manrope-latin.woff2" as="font" type="font/woff2" crossorigin />
    <meta name="generator" content={Astro.generator} />
    <script is:inline>document.documentElement.classList.add('js');</script>
  </head>
  <body>
    <!--
      DIRECTION
      THESIS: A dark tank. Cobalt ink diffuses through black water in a real fluid simulation and the page
      sits on the glass above it. It refuses the dark agency landing (glow hero, icon cards, thumbnail grid)
      and the box grid: nothing on this page has a visible container except the glass the form sits on.
      OWN-WORLD: near-black water; one cobalt ink with a bright core; white Manrope 500 at label-on-glass
      scale, hairlines instead of boxes, generous vertical space; motion is diffusion, never sliding boxes.
      Objects surface from blur as the ink clears.
      STORY: "This studio has craft I can see, builds stores, automations and reports, and will quote a
      number." Then: send the form.
      FIRST VIEWPORT: the whole viewport is water. At load a single injection of ink draws the lemniscate
      and begins to dissolve. Headline "One studio for the whole shop." sits lower-left at 8vw, the lede
      under it, one white pill button, the four services as a quiet line of text. Wordmark top-left,
      three links top-right. The pointer stirs the ink.
      FORM: brief-pinned (fluid, technical, luxury minimal) after two bolder re-rolls failed the pin;
      candidate 2 of 3 presented; seed 61058b97.
      FINISH: unreviewed and undocumented is unfinished; this build ends with the finish review,
      the verdict, DESIGN.md, and every shipping raster carrying its provenance.
    -->
    <a class="skip" href="#main">Skip to content</a>
    <div class="tank" aria-hidden="true">
      <canvas id="tank"></canvas>
      <div class="still"></div>
    </div>
    <div class="page">
      <slot />
    </div>
  </body>
</html>
